From: Abzu <abzu@localhost>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] abzu: identify the fork in the kernel version string

Abzu kernel patch set (see kernel/patches/README.md): tag the shared
version[]/what(1) strings in config/version.c so uname -v and the version
banner read "Abzu ..." -- the marker rEFInd's about-this-Mac panel and
crash-report triage tooling key off. Generated with git diff against the
pinned tag xnu-7195.141.2.

---
diff --git a/config/version.c b/config/version.c
index 568b8be..ac5f704 100644
--- a/config/version.c
+++ b/config/version.c
@@ -37,7 +37,7 @@
 
 // for what(1):
 const char __kernelVersionString[] __attribute__((used)) = "@(#)VERSION: " OSTYPE " Kernel Version ###KERNEL_VERSION_LONG###: ###KERNEL_BUILD_DATE###; ###KERNEL_BUILDER###:###KERNEL_BUILD_OBJROOT###";
-const char version[] = OSTYPE " Kernel Version ###KERNEL_VERSION_LONG###: ###KERNEL_BUILD_DATE###; ###KERNEL_BUILDER###:###KERNEL_BUILD_OBJROOT###";
+const char version[] = "Abzu " OSTYPE " Kernel Version ###KERNEL_VERSION_LONG###: ###KERNEL_BUILD_DATE###; ###KERNEL_BUILDER###:###KERNEL_BUILD_OBJROOT###";
 const int  version_major = VERSION_MAJOR;
 const int  version_minor = VERSION_MINOR;
 const int  version_revision = VERSION_REVISION;
